--- !u!114 &345091309696320735
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "The <b>Lobby UI</b> exposes high level functionality that is driven through the <b>LobbyManager.cs</b> and the <b>XRINetworkGameManager.cs</b>\n\nThe Lobby UI features are:\n   \xB7 A scrollable list of UI buttons showing all active non-private rooms.\n   \xB7 An Input field  UI button to join rooms using their corresponding <b>Room Code.</b>\n   \xB7 A UI button to <b>Quick Join</b> the first available Non-Private Room.\n   \xB7 A UI button to create a <b>New Room.</b>"
